# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 提交时产生 CRLF 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制 / 大文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary

# 资源文件按二进制处理，防止 git 误判
*.ppt binary
*.doc binary
*.xls binary
